 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Thomas fell to his knees in the room",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.32,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My Lord and my God he cried out loud",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus spoke words of grace and truth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who believe without sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These things are written for you to see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Believe Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By believing you may have life",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Found in his name, in his name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Many other signs were done before",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the presence of his disciples then",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not all are recorded in this book",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the purpose is clear and true",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These things are written for you to see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Believe Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By believing you may have life",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Found in his name, in his name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not just for Thomas who touched the scars",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But for all who trust without fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The record stands to guide your heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To faith that lasts and never fades",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
